**L0 `ce42d205e761` → `a1674f09497975cfd9f60840ab1c05942b79f19438bb7b8b260184ee48e2db28`** · L1 `315c19145065` **untouched**. Rebuild verified idempotent; 0 content-key diffs; `check_acceptance` PASS · `class_separation` clean · `validate_map` VALID. Measured effect: HF-14 fell from 15 files to 8, canonical ledger and all build inputs clear.

